<title>GERMANY: Berlin police say possible hijacked plane landed.</title>
<headline>Berlin police say possible hijacked plane landed.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>German police said on Tuesday an unidentified airplane that may have been hijacked had landed in Berlin.</p>
<p>&quot;We have an unscheduled landing at this time,&quot; a police spokeswoman said.  </p>
<p>The spokeswoman had no further details.</p>
<p>German all-news television station N-TV reported that the plane had landed at Berlin's Tegel airport.</p>
<p>The station also said the aircraft was believed to belong to a foreign air carrier.</p>
